import ../../../testing/driver.dl
import ../../../ui/source_tools.dl
import ../../../ui/source_panes.dl

appearance code appearance:
    height is 150
    padding is 12

document searching:
    source pane "Studio" containing "K k\r\nnext k" using code appearance
    source pane "River" containing "get hay" using code appearance

set instance to an instance of searching
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 700 by 800 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
enable UI source tools for workspace in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set studio to the UI source editor labeled "Studio" in workspace
set river to the UI source editor labeled "River" in workspace
set {river prefix} to the string form of "# hay belongs to the hidden context\n\n"
set files to a new JSON-RPC object
configure UI source document (river's document) named "river.dl" at "file:///river/river.dl" prefixed by river prefix using UI CPU analysis with files files
free files
require condition ((the UI search control labeled "Find text" in studio) != (the UI search control labeled "Find text" in river)) reporting "Source panes shared their query control identity."
restore UI source location (studio's current) in studio in (the address of view)
require condition (deliver UI input of kind 3 key 70 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)) reporting "The source Find shortcut did not claim its browser default."
require condition ((studio's search's visible) and (river's search's visible = false)) reporting "Find opened another pane."
set query to the UI search control labeled "Find text" in studio
require condition (view's text focus = query) reporting "Find did not use the shared field input context."
set UI text of query in window to "k"
refresh UI source search in studio in (the address of view)
require condition ((the length of (studio's search's model's matches)) = 3) reporting "Source search did not share Unicode folding."
set state to the UI text state for (studio's document) in studio in window
mark UI text (state's text) in layer "execution" at priority 10 in state
add UI text mark (UI ink 17 93 117) from 0 to 3 with opacity 80 in layer "execution" in state
move UI source search in studio forward true in (the address of view)
require condition (view's text focus = query) reporting "Search navigation stole typing focus from its query."
require condition ((the UI text mark layer named "execution" in state) != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text mark layer)) reporting "Search navigation cleared execution marks."
set (the UI value for (the UI search control labeled "Match case" in studio) in window)'s number to 1
refresh UI source search in studio in (the address of view)
require condition ((the length of (studio's search's model's matches)) = 2) reporting "Search options did not refresh an unchanged source."
require condition (deliver UI input of kind 3 key 72 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)) reporting "The replacement shortcut was not claimed."
set replacement to the UI search control labeled "Replace text" in studio
require condition (view's text focus = replacement) reporting "The replacement command did not focus its field."
set UI search text labeled "Replace text" in studio to "new"
require condition (deliver UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 6 containing "" in (the address of view)) reporting "Replace all did not claim its field shortcut."
require condition (view's text focus = replacement) reporting "Replacement stole focus from its field."
require condition (studio's document's source = "K new\r\nnext new") reporting "Replace all changed unrelated bytes or missed a match."
require condition (river's document's source = "get hay") reporting "Replace crossed source-project boundaries."
restore UI source location (studio's current) in studio in (the address of view)
ignore deliver UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
synchronize UI source workspace workspace at (view's seconds) seconds
require condition (studio's document's source = "K k\r\nnext k") reporting "Replace all was not one undoable source transaction."
set main to studio's document
set helper to a UI source document named "helper.dl" at "file:///lib/helper.dl" containing "readonly k" in (main's project)
show UI source document helper in studio in (the address of view)
refresh UI source search in studio in (the address of view)
require condition ((replace UI source search in studio all true in (the address of view)) = false) reporting "Find bypassed an imported source's read-only policy."
ignore deliver UI input of kind 3 key 72 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
require condition (view's text focus = query) reporting "Replacement in a read-only source did not retain a searchable query field."
close UI source search in studio in (the address of view)
show UI source document main in studio in (the address of view)
set state to the UI text state for main in studio in window
require condition ((the UI text mark layer named "editor search" in state) = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text mark layer)) reporting "Closing Find retained highlights in a parked source."
require condition ((the UI text mark layer named "execution" in state) != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text mark layer)) reporting "Closing Find erased another feature's layer."
show UI source search in river replacing true focusing query true in (the address of view)
set UI search text labeled "Find text" in river to "hay"
set UI search text labeled "Replace text" in river to "grain"
refresh UI source search in river in (the address of view)
require condition ((the length of (river's search's model's matches)) = 1) reporting "Embedded search included its hidden vocabulary context."
require condition (replace UI source search in river all true in (the address of view)) reporting "Embedded replacement did not map through its hidden context."
require condition ((river's document's source = "get grain") and (river's document's prefix = river prefix)) reporting "Embedded replacement changed its hidden context or used analysis coordinates as visible coordinates."
require condition (studio's document's source = "K k\r\nnext k") reporting "Embedded replacement changed the standalone editor."
close UI source search in river in (the address of view)
show UI source search in studio replacing false focusing query true in (the address of view)
free UI source workspace workspace
require condition (window's handlers = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI handler)) reporting "Freeing the workspace retained command callbacks."
require condition (view's input context's active = false) reporting "Freeing Find kept its input context alive."
close the address of view
close window
print line "Source Find and Replace share scoped fields, Unicode matching, focus, independent marks, atomic undo and read-only project policy."
